# What EAS uploads for an app build: only the mobile workspace, not the website, backend or their 1.8 GB of public files.
# An .easignore replaces .gitignore for the upload, so the mobile folder's ignored files are listed here too.
/*
!/mobile

/mobile/builds/
/mobile/apps/*/public/
/mobile/apps/*/android/
/mobile/apps/*/ios/
/mobile/apps/*/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/.env*
